@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### Estado de la API
GET http://localhost:5000/api/health

### Listar productos
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### Buscar por título o artista
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?search=midnight

### Crear producto sin portada
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=GrooveShelfBoundary

--GrooveShelfBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Disco de prueba
--GrooveShelfBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="artist"

Artista de prueba
--GrooveShelfBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="genre"

Rock
--GrooveShelfBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="format"

Vinilo
--GrooveShelfBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="year"

2026
--GrooveShelfBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="price"

19990
--GrooveShelfBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="stock"

5
--GrooveShelfBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Producto creado desde el archivo requests.http.
--GrooveShelfBoundary--
